        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(urnetwork_extender_releases_total{env=\"$env\"}[1h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Gated release requests by outcome: ok released records; empty (nothing eligible), country_capacity, incompatible and unavailable released nothing; rate_limited, epoch_spent and probation refuse the requester by design. No requests through 2026-11-11 (the gated tier had no members). The monitor warns when clients ask and under half the answers release (extender-gated-release-failing)."
    },
