        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (host) (process_open_fds{env=\"$env\",service=\"gossip\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} open fds"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_gossip_conn_manager_watermark{env=\"$env\",service=\"gossip\",level=\"high\"})",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "high watermark"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "warp-mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(urnetwork_gossip_conn_manager_watermark{env=\"$env\",service=\"gossip\",level=\"low\"})",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "low watermark"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The members and extenders each gossip replica holds a link to (its open fds count the same plus the process's own; a build before the link gauge exports only fds). Above the high watermark the replica closes links past their 60 s grace down to the low one and the members redial: the 67-second trim loop of 2026-11-11, when 13-15k members wanted links from four replicas of 1024. The monitor warns above 90% of the watermark for 30 minutes or above it for 10 (gossip-mesh-saturated)."
    },
